OL,3,GNEWSCBFI launches project to preserve  
OL,4,Ccomplete TV-am archive                 
OL,6,FThe BFI National Archive has begun a   
OL,7,Fpreservation project to safeguard the  
OL,8,Fentire TV-am collection, comprising    
OL,9,Fsome 10,000 hours of the breakfast     
OL,10,Ftelevision service broadcast on ITV    
OL,11,Fbetween 1983 and 1992.                 
OL,13,FTV-am went on air in February 1983 with
OL,14,FGood Morning Britain, broadcasting live
OL,15,Feach morning from its Breakfast        
OL,16,FTelevision Centre studios at Camden    
OL,17,FLock. Its final edition was presented  
OL,18,Fby Mike Morris and Lorraine Kelly on   
OL,19,F31st December 1992.                    
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
