OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 141 Wed 25 NovC23:11/36
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/10
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBFI launches project to preserve  
OL,4,Ccomplete TV-am archive                 
OL,6,FThe BFI says the archive is one of the 
OL,7,Flargest surviving collections of live  
OL,8,Fbroadcast television in the world. It  
OL,9,Fhas spent the past two years acquiring 
OL,10,Fthe collection, including assessing    
OL,11,Fthousands of the original videotapes,  
OL,12,Fand is now documenting, cataloguing and
OL,13,Fdigitising the material.               
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
