CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 141 Wed 25 NovC23:11/36
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/10
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBFI launches project to preserve  
OL,4,Ccomplete TV-am archive                 
OL,6,GTAPES AT RISK                          
OL,8,FAccording to the BFI, the collection is
OL,9,Fheld on videotape formats that are at  
OL,10,Frisk of deterioration and technical    
OL,11,Fobsolescence. Replacement parts are no 
OL,12,Flonger commercially available, and the 
OL,13,Fspecialist playback equipment, manuals 
OL,14,Fand engineering skills needed to       
OL,15,Fmaintain them are becoming increasingly
OL,16,Fscarce.                                
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
