OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 141 Wed 25 NovC23:11/36
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G4/10
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBFI launches project to preserve  
OL,4,Ccomplete TV-am archive                 
OL,6,FWhile individual clips have featured in
OL,7,Fdocumentaries and other programmes     
OL,8,Fsince TV-am came off air, the full     
OL,9,Fprogrammes have not been preserved. The
OL,10,FBFI describes the work as              
OL,11,Ftime-critical.                         
OL,13,FThe project will involve a team of     
OL,14,Fspecialists handling the inspection,   
OL,15,Frepair, conservation and curation of   
OL,16,Fthe tapes. The BFI also plans to train 
OL,17,Fnew conservators through traineeships  
OL,18,Fat the National Archive, to ensure the 
OL,19,Fskills are passed on.                  
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
