OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 141 Wed 25 NovC23:11/36
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G6/10
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBFI launches project to preserve  
OL,4,Ccomplete TV-am archive                 
OL,6,GWHAT THE COLLECTION HOLDS              
OL,8,FAlongside Good Morning Britain, the    
OL,9,Fcollection includes Daybreak, Frost on 
OL,10,FSunday, First Report, After Nine and   
OL,11,Fchildren's programmes such as Wide     
OL,12,FAwake Club and Wacaday, as well as     
OL,13,Fappearances by Roland Rat.             
OL,15,FThe BFI estimates TV-am welcomed around
OL,16,F30,000 guests over its decade on air.  
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
