OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 141 Wed 25 NovC23:11/36
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G7/10
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBFI launches project to preserve  
OL,4,Ccomplete TV-am archive                 
OL,6,FPolitical interviewees included        
OL,7,FMargaret Thatcher, Harold Wilson,      
OL,8,FEdward Heath, Arthur Scargill and Tony 
OL,9,FBlair, and the station secured         
OL,10,FBritain's first television phone       
OL,11,Finterview with Nelson Mandela, eight   
OL,12,Fdays after his release from prison.    
OL,14,FNews coverage in the archive spans the 
OL,15,Fminers' strike, general elections and  
OL,16,FMargaret Thatcher's resignation, as    
OL,17,Fwell as tragedies including the        
OL,18,FLockerbie air disaster, Hillsborough,  
OL,19,FPiper Alpha and the Great Storm.       
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
