OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 141 Wed 25 NovC23:11/36
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G8/10
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBFI launches project to preserve  
OL,4,Ccomplete TV-am archive                 
OL,6,FLisa Kerrigan, senior television       
OL,7,Fcurator at the BFI National Archive,   
OL,8,Fcalled the collection "a milestone in  
OL,9,FBritish television history" and a      
OL,10,Funique record of life in the UK in the 
OL,11,F1980s and early 1990s. She said the    
OL,12,Fhistorical tape formats needed expert  
OL,13,Fand costly assessment and preservation.
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
