OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G9/10
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCBFI launches project to preserve  
OL,4,Ccomplete TV-am archive                 
OL,6,GFUNDRAISING APPEAL                     
OL,8,FTo support the work, the BFI has       
OL,9,Flaunched a public fundraising campaign,
OL,10,Fthe BFI Collections Fund. It is seeking
OL,11,Fdonations to fund the year-round work  
OL,12,Fof the National Archive, including the 
OL,13,Fprotection of the TV-am collection.    
OL,15,FThe project and the fund were announced
OL,16,Fat a launch event at BFI Southbank on  
OL,17,F24th November 2026.                    
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
